{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14700","headline":"宿蓝田山口奉寄沈员外 · 于良史","name":"宿蓝田山口奉寄沈员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山暝飞羣鸟，川长泛四邻。\n烟归河畔草，月照渡头人。\n朋友怀东道，乡关恋北辰。\n去留无所适，岐路独迷津。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于良史","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14700.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14700","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}